%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 2547e55ec9dfbbef9928c19f015c725e, type: 3}
  m_Name: Task18English
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: JustSomeStars.Runtime::JustSomeStars.Runtime.Atlas.LocalizedEnglishCatalog
  entries:
  - key: dialogue.mirra.arrival.text
    value: Look at that line between day and night. Mirra wears its sunrise all the
      way around.
  - key: dialogue.mirra.hint.text
    value: No rush. Try the thermal imager where orange light meets blue shadow.
  - key: dialogue.mirra.juno-repair.text
    value: "The probe is listening again. Nice work\u2014clean signal, no shortcuts."
  - key: dialogue.mirra.ori-fragment.text
    value: Signal fragment secured. Route home is ready when you are.
  - key: atlas.mirra.temperature.short
    value: Mirra has a permanent hot day side and a cold night side.
  - key: atlas.mirra.temperature.balanced
    value: Mirra keeps one face toward its star, while its atmosphere moves heat
      from permanent day toward permanent night.
  - key: atlas.mirra.temperature.deep
    value: On a tidally locked world, atmospheric circulation can reduce the temperature
      contrast between the permanent day and night hemispheres. Mirra's thermal gradient
      is evidence of that continuing heat transport.
  - key: objective.mirra.prelanding
    value: Hold the safe approach corridor.
  - key: objective.mirra.landed
    value: Land on Mirra's twilight shelf.
  - key: objective.mirra.traversal
    value: Cross the line between day and night.
  - key: objective.mirra.evidence
    value: Compare hot-side and cold-side readings with the thermal imager.
  - key: objective.mirra.repair
    value: Repair the silent climate probe with Juno and Ori.
  - key: objective.mirra.fragment
    value: Recover the Signal fragment at the violet spire.
  - key: objective.mirra.departure-request
    value: Return to the lander and depart Mirra.
  - key: objective.mirra.departure-confirm
    value: Flight route is loading.
  - key: objective.mirra.complete
    value: Mirra field mission complete.
